                                          <Label alignment="TOP_LEFT" layoutX="13.0" layoutY="12.0" lineSpacing="7.0" prefHeight="126.0" prefWidth="554.0" text=" 1. Create a CV profile using Create a New CV Profile button.&#10; 2. Each section will have Add buttons.&#10; 3. Use Add button to add fields or more content&#10; 4. After entering all details, click Save This Profile button.&#10; 5. Finally View CV profile in Edit CV table." textAlignment="JUSTIFY" />
